\mathbf{M} \begin{pmatrix} y \\ 2y + 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 5 & 1 \\ 7 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} y \\ 2y + 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7y + 1 \\ 9y + 2 \end{pmatrix}.
\]
Thus, the image of the line $y = 2x + 1$ under $\mathbf{M}$ is $y = \frac{9}{7}x + \frac{5}{7}$.

